      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I obtained three quotes, however, the quote from Ozmak Electrical was the most informative being highlighted with 2 options that maximised performance, with corresponding expected performance graphs.  The quote was very competitive and I decided to commission that company.  I made the right decision, the system was installed without a hitch, Gavin (the business owner and installer) from Ozmak was informative, his work extremely tidy, and nothing seemed to be a problem.  He obviously takes the utmost pride in his work evident by the high quality of his workmanship. My roof profile was problematic due to its shape, Gavin solved it with an aesthetic and efficient panel placement.  During the install he renewed some aging components in my switchboard, replaced a couple of dodgy roof tiles and even cut down a couple of trees that were shading some of the panels!  After the install he gave me a complete run down on the system and did not leave until I was satisfied regarding the install.  I thoroughly recommend Ozmak, if you are looking for old fashioned personalised service and a quality install at a cost effective price, do not go past this installer.",
